---
description: Deterministic rules engine
globs: apps/api/app/rules/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- NO AI. No anthropic, openai, langchain, langgraph imports. CI enforces this.
- Each rule is a YAML file in definitions/: id, when, severity, evidence_query, action_owner (default contractor), autonomy_tier (default draft), thresholds
- `now` is passed in. Never call datetime.now() inside a rule.
- Rules upsert exceptions (same input twice = same result)
- Test every rule at its boundary (e.g. 30 days fires, 31 does not)
- Thresholds are guesses until the co-founder confirms; mark them so in the YAML
